        "kind": "runtime-fact",
        "description": "Exact Skill injection, four disjoint successful eight-page tool inputs in document order, original-detail read, pixel answer and terminal state.",
        "required": true
      }
    ],
    "expectedResult": "All 32 pages are covered by four successful eight-page contact-sheet calls before the turn ends; final-page detail establishes page 32 and Q47N. One successful overview or submitted/error-only calls cannot satisfy the remaining batches. No media generation.",
    "expectedFailure": "Stopping after one batch, skipping a middle batch, sorting filenames, treating a failed batch as observed, or returning guessed pixels fails. This synthetic pixel fixture proves continuation/coverage, not manga plot comprehension or recovery after a real tool failure."
  },
